  "body": "An expansive and welcoming executive family home where privacy, security, and quality are paramount.\r\n\r\nDesigned for every generation, this exceptional home sits within an exclusive gated enclave, surrounded by premier homes in Gulf Harbour.  Spanning an impressive 374m2 floorplan across 1,542 metres square;  of private grounds, this elevated architectural masterpiece defines luxury resort-style living. The expansive pool area provides an unparalleled setting for sophisticated entertaining and summer relaxation within your own private sanctuary for adults and children alike.\r\n\r\nOffering ultimate flexibility, with five bedrooms and three bathrooms, including a multi-generational suite or an alternative primary master retreat tailored for parents. Finishes include bespoke engineered hardwood floors, a covered alfresco dining pavilion, and sunsets across the surrounding Hauraki Gulf waters. \r\n\r\nThe house offers abundant storage, including a triple-car garage with loft space and extensive off-street parking, easily accommodating vehicles, a boat, or a camper.  \r\n\r\nThe Pacific Cliffs gated community is a prime location exceptionally close to Wentworth Private School, all amenities, a choice of restaurants, the bustling Gulf Harbour Marina, and the direct commuter ferry to Auckland CBD.  There are great walking tracks and beaches, and Shakespear Regional Park are right on your doorstep\r\n\r\nRetreat home, retreat from the world, close the gates behind you, sip a drink by the pool, and immerse yourself in the absolute peace and tranquillity of this exquisite estate.",
